        "payload": "tree 6dd1e9efb400080e4cf526df444a459c0a70bdce\nparent dbd35d92a36a612367d25f7b27154d11d19f842e\nauthor Meylis <meylis@divine.video> 1779700447 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779700447 +0500\n\nfeat(dm): auto-grow message composer to 5 lines (#4620) (#4709)\n\nThe composer was locked to one line in a fixed-height pill, so long\nmessages scrolled horizontally with no way to insert a line break. Match\nthe comments / inline composers: minHeight pill + minLines 1 / maxLines\n5, multiline keyboard, Return inserts a newline (send is the button\nonly), and drop withNoTextScaling so the field honours system font\nscaling.\n\nMarkdown selection toolbar (#4621) and the trim/newline send path are\nunchanged. Adds multiline-config and newline-preservation tests.",
